  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 103.46 Low permeability cap",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 103.46 “Low permeability cap” means a cap installed for landfill closure with a permeability of not greater than 1 x 10 -5 cm/sec.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 103.40) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
